mtproto-core sec_rows_zeroize::a_transport_stream_leaves_no_proxy_secret_or_obfuscation_key_in_freed_memory,
mtproto-core sec_rows_zeroize::a_fake_tls_stream_leaves_no_proxy_key_in_freed_memory,
mtproto-engine sec_rows_zeroize::a_session_with_an_address_secret_leaves_no_secret_in_freed_memory,
