+/// Directly, through SOCKS5 and HTTP `CONNECT`, open and with credentials, and through each MTProxy secret kind, the
+/// check answers with its first attempt, its round trip measured, after one plain request: no key handshake step past
+/// it, no encrypted packet, and the header carried the obfuscation id given. The client closes the connection.
