+/// A request that stalls behind a SOCKS5 tunnel made and behind a verified fake-TLS ServerHello ends at the bound,
+/// never at the tunnel or the hello: the request left after them. A server that takes the connection and never
+/// reads a frame ends there too, with no request read.
+#[test]
+fn a_silent_route_ends_at_the_timeout_never_at_the_tunnel_or_the_hello() {
